    		 *
    		 * This code only retrieves descriptions of LOVs. Errors are ignored by purpose.
    		 *
    		 * You are free to show the errors on the response, if you want.
    		 *
    		 * !!! WARNING !!! WARNING !!! WARNING !!! WARNING !!! WARNING !!! WARNING !!! WARNING !!!
    		 */
    try {
